  "releaseNotes": "## 3.1.0\n### Added\n- Mapping strictness and nested-object creation settings on MySQL query providers.\n- SourceLink metadata and deterministic portable symbols.\n\n### Changed\n- Provider now delegates shared execution and mapping behavior to RelationalQueryEngine.\n- Uses the generated and cached-ordinal mapping pipeline supplied by MerlinORM.Client 3.1.0.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- Requires MerlinORM.Client 3.1.0 and its updated mapping contracts.",
